#. それが、私の発言にどう関わってくるのかしら？
#. それとも…何も考えていないの？
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What does that have to do with what I said? Or do you\n"
"just not know what you're doing?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ああ？　小難しい事言いやがって…
#. どういうことだ、ゴラァ！？
msgctxt "0003 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"The hell are you talkin' about? Just shut up, ya\n"
"little bitch!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ああ？　小難しい事言いやがって…
#. どういうことだ、ゴラァ！？
msgctxt "0005 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"The hell are you talkin' about? Just shut up, ya\n"
"little bitch!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ほうほう、なるほど。
#. それはつまり…って全然わかんねーぞ！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hmm, yes, I see. So what you're saying is...I have\n"
"absolutely no idea!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君も聞いたわね…
#. 今の…あの人の不用意な発言を…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You heard him, right? What he just said without even\n"
"realizing it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…今の誰かの発言に、
#. 何かおかしな点があるって事か…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are you saying there's something off about what\n"
"someone just said?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君も聞いたわね…
#. 今の…あの人の不用意な発言を…
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"You heard him, right? What he just said without even\n"
"realizing it?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確かに、今の“彼”の発言はおかしいぞ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's right... What he said just now is really odd.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼はどうして…あんな事を知ってたんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How did he know something like that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
